{"seq":3,"slug":"lc0015-three-sum","title":"LeetCode 15 三数之和","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0015-three-sum","wordCount":879,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-15-三数之和\">LeetCode 15 三数之和</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你一个整数数组 <code>nums</code>，判断是否存在三元组 <code>[nums[i], nums[j], nums[k]]</code> 满足 <code>i != j</code>、<code>i != k</code> 且 <code>j != k</code>，同时还满足 <code>nums[i] + nums[j] + nums[k] == 0</code>。请你返回所有和为 0 且不重复的三元组。</p>\n<p><strong>注意：</strong> 答案中不可以包含重复的三元组。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>3 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 3000</code></li>\n<li><code>-10^5 &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 10^5</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [-1, 0, 1, 2, -1, -4]&#10;输出：[[-1, -1, 2], [-1, 0, 1]]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [-1, 0, 1, 2, -1, -4]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[[-1, -1, 2], [-1, 0, 1]]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [0, 1, 1]&#10;输出：[]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [0, 1, 1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [0, 0, 0]&#10;输出：[[0, 0, 0]]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [0, 0, 0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[[0, 0, 0]]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三数之和是 Two Sum 的自然延伸，也是面试中出现频率极高的题目。它的核心难点不在于找到满足条件的三元组，而在于如何高效地<strong>去重</strong>。排序 + 双指针的组合提供了优雅的解决方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"从-two-sum-到-three-sum\">从 Two Sum 到 Three Sum</h3><p>Two Sum（LC #1）求的是两个数之和等于 target。三数之和可以转化为：固定一个数 <code>nums[i]</code>，在剩余数组中找两个数之和等于 <code>-nums[i]</code>。这就把三数之和降维为 Two Sum。</p>\n<p>如果对每个 <code>nums[i]</code> 都用哈希表做 Two Sum，时间复杂度为 O(n²)，但去重逻辑会很复杂。更好的做法是先排序，然后用双指针。</p>\n<h3 id=\"排序-双指针\">排序 + 双指针</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>排序</strong>：将数组升序排列，排序后相同的元素相邻，方便去重</li>\n<li><strong>固定第一个数</strong>：遍历数组，固定 <code>nums[i]</code> 作为三元组的第一个数</li>\n<li><strong>双指针搜索</strong>：在 <code>i+1</code> 到 <code>n-1</code> 的范围内，用左右双指针寻找两数之和等于 <code>-nums[i]</code></li>\n<li><strong>去重</strong>：在三个位置上都需要跳过重复值</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"去重的关键\">去重的关键</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>去重位置</th>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一个数</td>\n<td><code>i &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; nums[i] === nums[i-1]</code></td>\n<td>避免固定相同的第一个数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二个数</td>\n<td>找到解后 <code>left++</code> 直到值变化</td>\n<td>避免相同的第二个数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三个数</td>\n<td>找到解后 <code>right--</code> 直到值变化</td>\n<td>避免相同的第三个数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"剪枝优化\">剪枝优化</h3><ul>\n<li>如果 <code>nums[i] &gt; 0</code>，因为数组已排序，后面的数都大于 0，三数之和不可能为 0，直接终止</li>\n<li>如果 <code>nums[i] + nums[i+1] + nums[i+2] &gt; 0</code>，当前 <code>i</code> 的最小三数之和已大于 0，终止</li>\n<li>如果 <code>nums[i] + nums[n-2] + nums[n-1] &lt; 0</code>，当前 <code>i</code> 的最大三数之和仍小于 0，跳过此 <code>i</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function threeSum(nums: number[]): number[][] {&#10;  const result: number[][] = [];&#10;  nums.sort((a, b) =&gt; a - b);&#10;  const n = nums.length;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; n - 2; i++) {&#10;    if (nums[i] &gt; 0) {&#10;      break;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if (i &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; nums[i] === nums[i - 1]) {&#10;      continue;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    let left = i + 1;&#10;    let right = n - 1;&#10;    const target = -nums[i];&#10;&#10;    while (left &lt; right) {&#10;      const sum = nums[left] + nums[right];&#10;&#10;      if (sum === target) {&#10;        result.push([nums[i], nums[left], nums[right]]);&#10;&#10;        while (left &lt; right &amp;&amp; nums[left] === nums[left + 1]) {&#10;          left++;&#10;        }&#10;        while (left &lt; right &amp;&amp; nums[right] === nums[right - 1]) {&#10;          right--;&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        left++;&#10;        right--;&#10;      } else if (sum &lt; target) {&#10;        left++;&#10;      } else {&#10;        right--;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> threeSum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  nums.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      break</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      continue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</sp