<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        result.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([nums[i], nums[left], nums[right]]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[left] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[right] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>执行过程示例：</strong></p>\n<p>以 <code>nums = [-1, 0, 1, 2, -1, -4]</code> 为例：</p>\n<p>排序后：<code>[-4, -1, -1, 0, 1, 2]</code></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>i</th>\n<th>nums[i]</th>\n<th>target</th>\n<th>left</th>\n<th>right</th>\n<th>sum</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>-1+2=1</td>\n<td>sum&lt;target, left++</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>-1+2=1</td>\n<td>sum&lt;target, left++</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>0+2=2</td>\n<td>sum&lt;target, left++</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>1+2=3</td>\n<td>sum&lt;target, left++</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>-1+2=1</td>\n<td>找到 [-1,-1,2]，去重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>0+1=1</td>\n<td>找到 [-1,0,1]，去重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>跳过（与前一个相同）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>1+2=3</td>\n<td>sum&gt;target, right--</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最终结果：<code>[[-1, -1, 2], [-1, 0, 1]]</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n²)</td>\n<td>排序 O(n log n) + 双层循环 O(n²)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>排序所需的栈空间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度分析：</strong> 排序的时间为 O(n log n)。外层循环遍历 n 个元素，内层双指针最多遍历 n 个元素，因此双层循环的时间为 O(n²)。总时间为 O(n²)，排序的 O(n log n) 被吸收。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度分析：</strong> 不计输出数组的空间，排序使用 O(log n) 的栈空间。输出结果的空间取决于三元组的数量，最坏情况为 O(n²)。</p>\n<p><strong>从三数之和到 K 数之和：</strong> 三数之和的思路可以推广到 K 数之和：先排序，然后用递归将 K 数之和降维到 Two Sum。每层递归固定一个数并去重，最后一层用双指针。K 数之和的时间复杂度为 O(n^(K-1))。LC #18（四数之和）就是 K=4 的情况。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 15 三数之和","id":"leetcode-15-三数之和"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":3,"text":"从 Two Sum 到 Three Sum","id":"从-two-sum-到-three-sum"},{"level":3,"text":"排序 + 双指针","id":"排序-双指针"},{"level":3,"text":"去重的关键","id":"去重的关键"},{"level":3,"text":"剪枝优化","id":"剪枝优化"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 11 盛最多水的容器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0011-container-with-most-water"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 31 下一个排列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0031-next-permutation"}}